  "substantiveCorrections": [
    {
      "id": "answers-690-104-normalized-vector",
      "section": "7.2.1.6",
      "cnPdfPage": 690,
      "location": "答104(a)首部，英文印805",
      "original": "\\max(x_1,\\ldots,x_n)=x_m=1",
      "final": "\\max(|x_1|,\\ldots,|x_n|)=x_m=1",
      "basis": "为同段按行对角占优推论取绝对值最大的分量再缩放为正1。旧写仍足以处理非正非对角项的拉普拉斯矩阵，新增绝对值供任意符号对称矩阵使用。",
      "cnPrintedPage": 675,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "9eb0e4a1a8b932e511d544aa35dd38911c847c1d25bffc8a97ffc0f68124c01f"
    },
    {
      "id": "answers-691-104-diagonal-dominance",
      "section": "7.2.1.6",
      "cnPdfPage": 691,
      "location": "答104(a)中括注，英文印806",
      "original": "c_{mm}\\ge|\\sum_{j\\ne m}c_{mj}|",
      "final": "c_{mm}\\ge\\sum_{j\\ne m}|c_{mj}|",
      "basis": "两源将绝对值套在整个和上。反例对称矩阵[[0,1,-1],[1,2,1],[-1,1,0]]满足原条件，(1,0,1)二次型为−2。逐项绝对值之和与答104(a)取最大分量的证明相符。",
      "cnPrintedPage": 676,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "56c4825088ccd8fdfce094c1bda1bb69e1baf22fd6f078194033d1d200a7db85"
    },
    {
      "id": "answers-691-105-xor-minus",
      "section": "7.2.1.6",
      "cnPdfPage": 691,
      "location": "答105(h)奇积谱式，英文印806",
      "original": "d'-\\alpha'_j n'[j=0]",
      "final": "d'-\\alpha'_j-n'[j=0]",
      "basis": "两源均漏去n′项之前的负号。由奇积邻接矩阵A′⊗(J″−A″)+(J′−A′)⊗A″同对角化。K₂与K₂的奇积为C₄，旧j=k=0得2而非0。有限核所有不超过5个结点的图册正则图有序对。",
      "cnPrintedPage": 676,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "56c4825088ccd8fdfce094c1bda1bb69e1baf22fd6f078194033d1d200a7db85"
    },
    {
      "id": "answers-692-106-cycle-fourier",
      "section": "7.2.1.6",
      "cnPdfPage": 692,
      "location": "答106(b)(c)周期谱解，英文印807",
      "original": "x_n=x_0；0\\le j<\\lceil n/2\\rceil时取cos 2kθ，其余取sin kθ",
      "final": "$\\lfloor n/2\\rfloor<j<n$，可用 $x_k=\\sin 2k\\theta$",
      "basis": "双语旧式的正弦缺因子2，偶n漏j=n/2的非零余弦；修正为完整周期条件与互补索引。在n=4原j=2正弦给2而非对应投影4。逐个验证n=3–20向量的两个周期边界、特征残差及满秩。",
      "cnPrintedPage": 677,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "20fb92e825d12ccd99f6b8b21dfccfc84b2a64602b810f5e82351d14c742a9c5"
    },
    {
      "id": "answers-692-106-largest-grid-prime",
      "section": "7.2.1.6",
      "cnPdfPage": 692,
      "location": "答106末段矩形栅格有限断言，英文印807",
      "original": "m≤n≤10中最大素因数1009",
      "final": "最大素因数是 $9\\,131\\,809$",
      "basis": "核完整1≤m≤n≤10的55个矩形，逐格比较整数矩阵树余子式与独立整系数结式，完整分解确认新最大素数只在(7,8)。保留原正确的(6,9)、1009及结式662913。",
      "cnPrintedPage": 677,
      "pageMarkdownSha256": "20fb92e825d12ccd99f6b8b21dfccfc84b2a64602b810f5e82351d14c742a9c5"
    },
    {
      "id": "answers-693-110-edge-bundle",
